# Model budget (user preference, 2026-08-17)

K3 (kimi-k3-max) is heavy usage — do NOT spend it on routine work.

- **Light work** (quick questions, small edits, status checks, simple file
  reads/summaries, coordination): use **Composer** (`composer-2.5-fast`).
- **Substantial coding** (firmware implementation, multi-file refactors,
  reverse-engineering analysis): use **Kimi Code** (`kimi-k2.7-code`).
- **K3** (`kimi-k3-max`): only when the task genuinely needs top-tier
  reasoning (e.g. subtle binary RE, hard debugging) or the user asks for it.

When delegating to subagents, pass the cheaper `model` slug that fits the
task instead of inheriting the parent model by default.
